      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A reverse hide-by-distance in this case would be pretty good IMO: automatically turning the avatar into a diamond when close to the player.\n\nI wonder if this idea could also work when personal space is turned on, for avatars that are still shown but turned into diamonds instead of disappearing completely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
